OL,3,GNEWSABuses to replace trains during
OL,4,Ajunction upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FNetwork Rail said it was an important
OL,7,Fpart of a plan to support Sizewell's
OL,8,Ftransport strategy of 60% of all
OL,9,Fmaterials being delivered by rail and
OL,10,Fsea, "reducing reliance on HGVs, [and]
OL,11,Freducing congestion and pollution on
OL,12,Flocal roads".
